  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DPG Phase VI: Support to National development plans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to DPG (Development Partners Group) Phase 6. The DPG was established in 2001, initially as the Development Assistance Group (DAG), and comprises 30 bilateral and multilateral partners. The DPG was established to foster and catalyse policy dialogue and to coordinate and harmonize development partners&apos; support for the Government of Ethiopia&apos;s preparation, implementation, monitoring and evaluation of the national development plan and the SDGs.</narrative>
  </description>
